      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "And the event relationships are:\n\nRider\n │\n ▼\nride_requested\n │\n ▼\ndriver_assigned\n │\n ▼\nride_started\n │\n ▼\nride_completed\n │\n ▼\npayment_completed",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "And the event relationships are:\n\nRider\n │\n ▼\nride_requested\n │\n ▼\ndriver_assigned\n │\n ▼\nride_started\n │\n ▼\nride_completed\n │\n ▼\npayment_completed",
